  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Inspired by field-proven military camouflage patterns and colors, our 100% Cotton Camo T-Shirts are an absolute must-have! Stay comfortable whether you&rsquo;re out playing a few rounds of airsoft, jogging on a morning run, or camping on the weekend. These camouflage t-shirts are great for military use, airsoft players, outdoor enthusiasts, skaters, gym-goers, and anyone who likes comfort and camo.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133328",
  "description": "<p>Inspired by field-proven military camouflage patterns and colors, our 100% Cotton Camo T-Shirts are an absolute must-have! Stay comfortable whether you&rsquo;re out playing a few rounds of airsoft, jogging on a morning run, or camping on the weekend. These camouflage t-shirts are great for military use, airsoft players, outdoor enthusiasts, skaters, gym-goers, and anyone who likes comfort and camo. Breathable &amp; Long-Lasting: Go ahead and wear your camo shirt without a worry! Made of 100% cotton, these camo t-shirts are soft and can easily withstand consistent use. The pure cotton construction allows the tee to absorb moisture off the skin. Solid Construction: The reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem further enhance the camouflage shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches. Built for Rugged Adventures: These Camouflage T-Shirts are standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for various activities, especially around the arms. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage while you&rsquo;re out and about. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your look with a pair of our BDU cargo pants or shorts. Complement your camo t-shirt with a solid color, or pair it with a matching camouflage color and pattern. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
